        "title": "LapMaster 12\"",
        "handle": "lapmaster-12",
        "descriptionHtml": "<p>AVAILABLE FOR SHIPPING, OR PICKUP IN: Wisconsin year-round, Arizona Jan/Feb</p>\n\n\n\n<p>This LAPMASTER is constructed from high quality steel, providing top-of-the-line stability to eliminate vibration, for smooth and excellent results.</p> \n\n\n\n<p>12” main lap compatible with magnetic grinding laps.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Can add Variable Speed: if you would like the ability to change the speed for different stones, you may add the Variable Speed Motor, adjustable from 500rpm up to 1500 rpm.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Motor: 0.75 kW monophase 1400 rpm</p>\n\n<p>Variable Speed Motor: 500rpm - 1500rpm</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Electricity: 110V 60Hz</p>\n\n<p>Cooling: water container</p>\n\n<p>Laps Diameter: 12” diameter</p>\n\n<p>Dimensions: 18” x 24” x 20”</p>\n\n<p>Weight: 90 Lbs.</p>\n\n<p>Packed safely in a wooden pallet box</p>",
